Cassotis Lexicon
https://github.com/shenmin/cassotis-lexicon

The project README declares CC BY-SA 4.0 for the dictionary.
The accompanying sources.public.yml identifies upstream sources and their licenses.
Cassotis macOS imports the generated lexical and language-model files into SQLite schema 24 without retraining the data.
The input files are from the Lexicon v2.5.0 release; their SHA-256 hashes are recorded in data/lexicon-inputs.json. Build output records are written to build/dictionaries/*.json.

